#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_sale_quote_followup.field_sale_order__followup_last_date
msgid "Last follow-up"
msgstr "Dernière relance"

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_sale_quote_followup.field_res_company__quote_followup_max
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_sale_quote_followup.field_res_config_settings__quote_followup_max
msgid "Maximum follow-ups"
msgstr "Nombre maximum de relances"

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_sale_quote_followup.field_sale_order__followup_next_date
msgid "Next automatic follow-up"
msgstr "Prochaine relance automatique"

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_sale_quote_followup.field_sale_order__followup_stop
msgid "No automatic follow-up"
msgstr "Pas de relance automatique"

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ag_sale_quote_followup.res_config_settings_view_form_quote_followup
msgid ""
"No reminder when the customer has answered in the chatter, when the quotation\n"
"                            has expired or when you tick \"No automatic follow-up\" on it."
msgstr ""
"Aucune relance si le client a répondu dans le fil de discussion, si le devis"
" a expiré ou si vous cochez « Pas de relance automatique » sur le devis."

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ag_sale_quote_followup.res_config_settings_view_form_quote_followup
msgid "Only quotations sent since"
msgstr "Seulement les devis envoyés depuis le"

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_sale_quote_followup.field_sale_order__followup_sent_date
msgid "Quotation sent on"
msgstr "Devis envoyé le"

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_sale_quote_followup.field_res_company__quote_followup_start_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_sale_quote_followup.field_res_config_settings__quote_followup_start_date
msgid ""
"Quotations sent before this date are never followed up automatically. On a "
"new installation it is set to the day the module is installed, so that old "
"quotations are not chased by surprise. Leave it empty to follow up every "
"sent quotation."
msgstr ""
"Les devis envoyés avant cette date ne sont jamais relancés automatiquement. "
"À une nouvelle installation, la date est fixée au jour d'installation du "
"module, pour que les anciens devis ne soient pas relancés par surprise. "
"Laissez la date vide pour relancer tous les devis envoyés."

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:ag_sale_quote_followup.ir_cron_quote_followup_ir_actions_server
msgid "Sales: automatic quotation follow-up"
msgstr "Ventes : relance automatique des devis"

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model:mail.template,name:ag_sale_quote_followup.mail_template_quote_followup
msgid "Sales: quotation follow-up"
msgstr "Ventes : relance de devis"

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_sale_quote_followup.field_sale_order__followup_sent_date
msgid ""
"Set when the quotation becomes Quotation Sent. The follow-up delay starts "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Renseignée quand le devis passe à l'état Devis envoyé. Le délai de relance "
"part de cette date."

#. module: ag_sale_quote_followup
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_sale_quote_followup.field_sale_order__followup_stop
msgid "Tick to never send automatic reminders for this quotation."
msgstr "Cochez pour ne jamais envoyer de relance automatique pour ce devis."

